{
  "name": "deals",
  "notes": [
    "SELF-AUTHORED SYNTHETIC FIXTURE. Not a recording of a real HubSpot account.",
    "Envelope shape follows HubSpot's public documentation for GET /crm/v3/objects/deals,",
    "including the associations block returned when the request asks for associations=contacts:",
    "associations.contacts.results[] carries bare object ids, never emails, which is why the",
    "deal reader needs a resolver and why deals must sync AFTER contacts.",
    "Deal 8803 is associated with contact id 999, which does not exist in the contacts",
    "cassette. It resolves to no email and is dead-lettered by the existing poison path.",
    "That is the intended demonstration of the ordering dependency between object types,",
    "not a defect in the fixture.",
    "Written for a client built with page_size=2."
  ],
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "path": "/crm/v3/objects/deals",
      "params": {
        "limit": "2",
        "associations": "contacts",
        "properties": "dealname,dealstage,pipeline,amount,closedate,hubspot_owner_id,hs_lastmodifieddate"
      },
      "status": 200,
      "headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "X-HubSpot-RateLimit-Remaining": "95"
      },
      "body": {
        "results": [
          {
